<title>SINGAPORE: Philippines Petron tenders to buy Oct/Nov fuel oil.</title>
<headline>Philippines Petron tenders to buy Oct/Nov fuel oil.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippines' Petron Corp has issued a tender to buy 150,000-200,000 barrels of fuel oil for October 26-30 or November 10-14 delivery, a company official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The tender seeks 180-centistoke grade fuel oil with a 0.5 or 1.0 percent sulphur content to be delivered on cost-and-freigt basis to Bataan.</p>
<p>The tender closes on October 9 and will be valid for one day.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
